    "First item (Jolly Pets Soccer Ball, USD 17.99) failed to add twice: an 'Added to cart' dialog appeared but the cart stayed empty; the two exports taken at those moments are failed-add evidence, not states. Second eligible item (KONG Tires) added fine.",
