    "Both PDP adds defaulted to 'Pick up in store' at a store the site chose (Davis); cart-1 and cart-2items show store-pickup fulfilment.",
    "empty-cart was exported at /cart (no trailing slash) before entering via the home page; /cart/ took about 16 s to render line items, so cart states were exported after waiting.",
